     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi D-RUGies, <div><br></div><div>Hope everyone&#39;s quarter is progressing smoothly. We are having our weekly worksession tomorrow from <b>10-12pm</b>, but temporarily (just this week) going to meet in <b>WICKSON 2124</b>. The DSI space is in use this week. </div><div><br></div><div><b><u>Package/Functions of the Week:</u></b></div><div><br></div><div>This week I wanted to point folks to a few nice options for grabbing web data or &quot;scraping&quot;. One is a package called &quot;<b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rvest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rvest/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466702018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0z2e0R1gbNrz_tpi-xELRl\">rvest</a></b>&quot;. A nice demo is here on <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/rvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/rvest&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466702018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16KRBdz-i0qtW94B6p-IAX\">github</a>. </div><div><br></div><div>I also want folks to know there are some great tools/knowledge that are available via Duncan Temple Lang over at the DSI. The materials from a recent workshop are <a href=\"https://github.com/dsidavis/WebScrapingFall17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/dsidavis/WebScrapingFall17&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466702018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GvU47W7m3AyAEc00b777T\">here</a> on github if you&#39;re interested. Some of the main packages used are <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/curl/vignettes/intro.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/curl/vignettes/intro.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466702018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WFGMLFQhW3-jqpzRhAVhR\"><b>curl</b></a> and <b><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/XML/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/XML/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466702018000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DUjb3f8RKZ7vamyagHk8E\">XML</a></b>, see the linked vignettes if interested!</div><div><br></div><div>Hope to see folks tomorrow, in Wickson 2124.</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div><div><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-sp